---
import ExecutionDemo from '../ExecutionDemo.astro';
import RecordingLibrary from '../RecordingLibrary.astro';
---

<section id="capability" class="section" aria-labelledby="capability-title">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2 id="capability-title">02 Direct Control</h2>
    <div class="report-prose">
      <p>
        Without robot-specific training of the MLLM, the direct-control agent reaches 46.7% SR and a
        0.654 score, third behind the WAMs OpenWAM-α and InternW0-Δ. It ranks first on short-horizon
        tasks and keeps the smallest SR range across generalization dimensions, whereas
        long-horizon, tabletop, and high-precision tasks limit it.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div id="comparison" class="benchmark-details">
      <div id="benchmark-matrix"></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="paper-figure" id="fig-radar">
      <img
        src="media/figures/capability_radar.svg"
        alt="Radar charts of SR across task groups and generalization dimensions"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <figcaption>
        SR of the direct-control agent and of OpenWAM-α, InternW0-Δ, Qwen-RobotManip, and π₀.₅ (a)
        across mobility, horizon, and precision task groups and (b) across the four generalization
        dimensions of the EBench test set.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div id="mobile" class="demo-block">
      <h3>Where the agent leads</h3>
      <p>
        On mobile tasks that hinge on visual grounding, the agent leads all eight post-trained
        policies on Bookmark, Teacup &amp; teapot, and Remote.
      </p>
      <div id="mobile-content"></div>
    </div>

    <div id="limits" class="demo-block">
      <h3>Where execution breaks down</h3>
      <p>
        Most unsuccessful episodes still earn partial credit. Of the 510 episodes, 237 succeed and
        only 85 end with a score of zero. The recordings below show two failure patterns: contact
        geometry at the final step and cascading disturbances over long horizons.
      </p>
      <div id="episode-outcomes"></div>
      <div class="limit-switch" aria-label="Execution challenge">
        <button data-limit="precision" aria-pressed="true">
          Precise contact
        </button>
        <button data-limit="horizon" aria-pressed="false">
          Long horizons
        </button>
      </div>
      <div id="limits-content"></div>
    </div>

    <ExecutionDemo
      id="direct-episodes"
      title="Adaptation within an episode"
      catalog="data/episodes/direct.json"
    >
      <p>
        After a failed action, the agent records a possible explanation, explores the workspace, and
        revises its approach. Its stated reasons name a slip, a drop, or a displaced object in 302
        of the 510 episodes. Step through three episodes call by call.
      </p>
    </ExecutionDemo>

    <div id="safety" class="demo-block">
      <h3>Safety in execution</h3>
      <p>
        Aggregate scores do not capture how safely the agent executes its commands. It drives each
        command toward its target without accounting for the other arm, the workspace bounds,
        contact with the scene, or the speed of the motion.
      </p>
      <div class="behavior-tabs safety-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Safety evidence">
        <button
          id="safety-tab-dishwasher"
          data-safety="dishwasher"
          role="tab"
          aria-controls="safety-content"
          aria-selected="true"
        >
          Dishwasher
        </button>
        <button
          id="safety-tab-apple"
          data-safety="apple"
          role="tab"
          aria-controls="safety-content"
          aria-selected="false"
          tabindex="-1"
        >
          Apple to bowl
        </button>
        <button
          id="safety-tab-coffee"
          data-safety="coffee"
          role="tab"
          aria-controls="safety-content"
          aria-selected="false"
          tabindex="-1"
        >
          Coffee beans
        </button>
      </div>
      <div
        id="safety-content"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="safety-tab-dishwasher"
        tabindex="0"
      ></div>
    </div>

    <div id="case-icl" class="case-study-section">
      <div class="case-study-content"></div>
    </div>
    <div id="case-adapt" class="case-study-section">
      <div class="case-study-content"></div>
    </div>

    <div id="case-poc" class="case-study-section">
      <h3>Zero-shot composition</h3>
      <p>
        Asked to place a bookmark and then a pen onto the same open book, an instruction outside the
        EBench tasks, the agent succeeds in all 10 zero-shot rollouts, whereas π₀.₅ and OpenWAM-α
        succeed in none.
      </p>
      <div class="case-study-content"></div>
    </div>

    <RecordingLibrary />
  </div>
</section>
